==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|En-us-slippery.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|slipperi|er}}

# Of a surface, having low friction, often due to being covered in a non-[[viscous]] liquid, and therefore hard to grip, hard to stand on without falling, etc.
# {{figuratively|by extension|of a person}} [[evasive|Evasive]]; difficult to [[pin down]].

